Task: A page titled "What is new" that loads the text file motd.txt from this site as soon as it opens and shows it ("Loading..." first, then the text, or "Could not load it." if the request fails). A Refresh button loads it again.

Your program:
```
type Model = { version: Int where it >= 0, text: Str, failed: Bool }

type Msg = Got(Str) | Failed(Str) | Refresh

fn init() -> Model = Model { version: 0 }

fn update(m: Model, msg: Msg) -> Model = match msg {
  Got(t) => m with { text: t, failed: false }
  Failed(e) => m with { failed: true }
  Refresh => Model { version: m.version + 1, text: "", failed: false }
}

